                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">All Qurubuti are armed with sword, light armour, throwing spear and large shield. Stubborn. 0-1 unit. Assyrian armies only. (Chariot Wars p.58)</characteristic>
