            <profile id="6d77-c5ae-c87b-9174" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="513c-2d0a-024a-da5a" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and composite bow. Chaldeans in a Babylonian army may have thrusting spears as well as bows (+1 pt) or may have thrusting spears and replace their bows with large shields (+1 pt). Half the unit may be equipped with spear and bow and the other half with thrusting spear and large shield, or the whole unit may all be equipped in the same way. In mixed units a single rank of archers may shoot over a single rank of spearmen. (Chariot Wars p.60)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="7b9c-a31c-f92b-1e20" name="Hand Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="a423-b782-e1ce-43e2" type="profile"/>
